{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001310/extras/gameplay.png?t=1740741817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001310/extras/adventurer.png?t=1740741817\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventurer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire adventurers, equip them with good gear, and level them up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can deploy adventurers to a variety of different buildings to produce items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001310/extras/deco.png?t=1740741817\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage buildings that produce a variety of items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your guild better by creating excellent facilities to gain a good reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001310/extras/farm.png?t=1740741817\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grow crops, harvest them, and sell them to earn gold, or use them for cooking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try cultivating a variety of crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001310/extras/example.png?t=1740741817\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are various buildings with different functions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your guild better and build various buildings such as dungeons, restaurants, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3001310?t=1740741817","back